{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"余单子"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"余单子"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>一个范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的<strong>余单子</strong> (comonad) 是 $\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal C)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合余代数","text":"结合余代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>. 余单子<strong>不是</strong> $\\mathcal C^{\\text{op}}$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"单子","text":"单子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>余单子与单纯对象</h3>\n<p>由于"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta$ 是 “一个对象生成的自由"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"”, 任意幺半范畴 $M$ 中的幺半对象都对应着函子 $\\Delta \\to M$, 也即 $M^{\\text{op}}$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}